cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "japanese-rag-swift (JapaneseRAGKit)"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Nakatsugawa
    given-names: Masahiro
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3224-0103"
abstract: >-
  A small Swift package for on-device Japanese retrieval-augmented generation on iOS and
  macOS: Japanese sentence chunking, ruri-v3 embeddings and a Japanese cross-encoder
  reranker on Core ML, an in-memory vector index and a retrieve-then-rerank pipeline. It
  does not include an LLM.
repository-code: "https://github.com/masahiroid/japanese-rag-swift"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - rag
  - japanese
  - swift
  - core-ml
  - on-device
  - ios
